WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
This entire brick strip is one whole. Look from its left edge all the way to its right edge.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Now divide the same strip into four equal pieces. The whole has not become bigger or smaller.

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Colour just one piece green. That piece is part of the whole.

4
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:43.000
The pale pieces still belong to the whole. The whole includes all four pieces, not only the green one.

5
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:53.000
One of four equal pieces is green. We call that one quarter of the whole.
